    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>2级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 36；''重伤'' 18</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 16，''强韧'' 14，''反射'' 15，''意志'' 11</span><span>''侦查'' +0</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 8，攀爬 8</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉，震动感知 10</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}穿刺啮咬（强酸）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+7 vs. AC<br>命中：1d8+4 伤害。该巢穴战蚁对任何已经承受有持续强酸伤害的目标造成 1d10 额外强<br>酸伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">巢穴战蚁狂怒✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>触发：当该巢穴战蚁 10 格内的任何巨蚁生命值降到 0 时。<br>该巢穴战蚁不再被标记或诅咒，然后该巢穴战蚁快步两格。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（巨蚁）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 14（+3）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 9（+0）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 12（+2）</span><span>''智力'' 2（-3）</span><span>''魅力'' 4（-2）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
